sentence_text:
The Ea: of Southampton said that had he carried himselfe so in any
other place but this he would not haue endured it and sharpely willed
him to behaue himselfe after a better manner;

The Ka: of Southampton said he would nowe proceed to the worke of
this daye namely to examine the rest of the Articles of m'’ Wrotes
Proiect;

nor [180] nor honestie nor good meaninge: and although with a
protestaton post factii, he would seeme to turne it from the Ea: of
Southampton himselfe, and the rest of the Counsell;
